SUMMARY:Documentary Competition: Group 4
DESCRIPTION:Fariha When Farah\, a 70-year-old Yemeni singer\, meets the young director Badr\, the two set out on a journey to revive Farah&rsquo\;s long-lost singing career. The Bundle of Saad documentary that follows the life and artistic journey of veteran actor Saad Al-Faraj\, tracing his career spanning over 50 years&mdash\;from his early life in the village of Fintas\, to his move to Kuwait in the 1950s\, his involvement with the Popular Theatre troupe\, and his influence by Zaki Tulaimat&mdash\;revealing how he helped shape the foundations of Kuwaiti and Gulf theatre as a witness to a pivotal artistic and historical era.
